    "updated_at": "2021-04-29T16:08:26Z",
    "body": "> It doesn't seem like it got automatically published\r\n\r\nHere is what Snapcraft API says today:\r\n```\r\n❯ curl -s -H 'Snap-Device-Series: 16' https://api.snapcraft.io/v2/snaps/info/starship\\?fields\\=version | jq '.[\"channel-map\"][0]'\r\n{\r\n  \"channel\": {\r\n    \"architecture\": \"amd64\",\r\n    \"name\": \"stable\",\r\n    \"released-at\": \"2021-04-28T15:32:49.463295+00:00\",\r\n    \"risk\": \"stable\",\r\n    \"track\": \"latest\"\r\n  },\r\n  \"version\": \"0.52.1\"\r\n}\r\n```\r\n\r\nAnd here is what Github releases feed says:\r\n```\r\n❯ curl -s https://github.com/starship/starship/releases.atom | grep -F '<title>v0.52.1' -C3\r\n    <id>tag:github.com,2008:Repository/178991158/v0.52.1</id>\r\n    <updated>2021-04-22T16:45:39Z</updated>\r\n    <link rel=\"alternate\" type=\"text/html\" href=\"https://github.com/starship/starship/releases/tag/v0.52.1\"/>\r\n    <title>v0.52.1</title>\r\n    <content type=\"html\">&lt;h2&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://github.com/starship/starship/compare/v0.51.0...v0.52.1&quot;&gt;v0.52.1&lt;/a&gt; (2021-04-22)&lt;/h2&gt;\r\n&lt;h3&gt;Bug Fixes&lt;/h3&gt;\r\n&lt;ul&gt;\r\n```\r\n\r\nSeems like there is some lag between the Github release (`2021-04-22T16:45:39Z`) and the Snapcraft release (`2021-04-28T15:32:49.46Z`). :shrug: \r\n\r\n**PS** Shameless plug ahead: \r\n\r\n![](https://badgen.net/snapcraft/v/starship)\r\n<details>\r\n<summary>badge source</summary>\r\n\r\n```md\r\n![](https://badgen.net/snapcraft/v/starship)\r\n```\r\nSee here for more snap badges: https://badgen.net/snapcraft\r\n</details>",
    "author_association": "MEMBER",
    "pin": null,
