    "body": "Btw, @LinusU you personally use snap distro, right?\r\nWe had some convo on Discord about it and I found it broken on my Linux Mint 19.2 install:\r\n\r\n- didn't allow me to alter config file using CLI\r\n![image](https://user-images.githubusercontent.com/1170440/116585273-80ca8f80-a918-11eb-9c11-e61e5e0d39ae.png)\r\n- used wrong config path (sandboxed homedir)\r\n![image](https://user-images.githubusercontent.com/1170440/116585406-a8215c80-a918-11eb-8d1c-664f9250affb.png)\r\n\r\nFinally, it results in weird behavior as seen here:\r\n![image](https://user-images.githubusercontent.com/1170440/116585466-bbccc300-a918-11eb-8697-7cf93ef61947.png)\r\n\r\n",
