    "body": "Hello, I am trying to use starship via snaps and noticed that it is far behind the latest release:\r\n\r\n```\r\n❯ snap info starship\r\nname:      starship\r\nsummary:   The minimal, blazing-fast, and infinitely customizable prompt for any shell!\r\npublisher: Matan Kushner (matankushner)\r\nstore-url: https://snapcraft.io/starship\r\n\r\n...stripped...\r\n\r\nchannels:\r\n  latest/stable:    1.6.3 2022-04-27 (2049) 3MB -\r\n  latest/candidate: ↑                           \r\n  latest/beta:      ↑                           \r\n  latest/edge:      1.9.1 2022-08-14 (2303) 3MB -\r\n```\r\n\r\nThe fact is known when I found that the `starship preset` command is not available when it should be, please consider promoting the release from the edge channel regularly.\r\n\r\n**UPDATE:** The `starship preset` command isn't available even after refreshing the snap to the edge channel.",
