    "body": "@vladimyr\r\n\r\n> used wrong config path (sandboxed homedir)\r\n\r\nSnapd doesn't prefer the config files in the user's REAL home directory for architectural design reasons (to avoid incompatible changes breaking other installations of the same application.)  Moving the config file to the sandboxed homedir is considered to be a workaround.\r\n\r\nThe current practice is to allow the snap to have _read-only_ access to the configuration file in the REAL home directory, and import it to the sandboxed homedir during the first launch process.",
    "author_association": "CONTRIBUTOR",
    "pin": null,
